---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="9 Games You Can Play While Chatting with Strangers | Airwalk Blog" description="Discover all 9 games on Airwalk — from Wordle to Truth or Dare. Break the ice and have fun while chatting with strangers.">
  <header class="fixed top-0 w-full z-50 bg-gray-900/80 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-gray-800">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-4 flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="/" class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Airwalk</a>
      <a href="/chat" class="bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white px-5 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium transition">Start Chatting</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-12 space-y-6 mt-20">
    <article class="space-y-6">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white">9 Games You Can Play While Chatting with Strangers on Airwalk</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Published on June 6, 2026</p>

      <p class="text-gray-300">Awkward silences? Not on Airwalk. We've built 9 multiplayer games directly into the chat experience so you and your match always have something fun to do together. Here's every game you can play while chatting with strangers.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">1. Wordle Battle</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">Race your chat partner to guess the five-letter word first. Competitive, addictive, and the perfect icebreaker.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">2. Truth or Dare</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">The classic party game, reimagined for anonymous strangers. Choose truth for deep questions or dare for hilarious challenges.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">3. Would You Rather</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">Impossible choices that reveal personality. Discover how your stranger thinks with every dilemma.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">4. 20 Questions</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">One person thinks of something, the other has 20 yes-or-no questions to figure it out. Simple yet endlessly entertaining.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">5. Trivia Challenge</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">Test your knowledge across categories — science, pop culture, history, and more. Bragging rights included.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">6. Story Builder</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">Take turns writing sentences to create a collaborative story. The results are always unpredictable and hilarious.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">7. Emoji Decoder</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">Describe movies, songs, or phrases using only emojis. Your partner guesses. Harder than it sounds.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">8. Two Truths and a Lie</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">Share three statements — your match guesses which one is false. A classic getting-to-know-you game.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">9. Quick Draw</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">Draw something on the shared canvas while your partner guesses what it is. No artistic skill required.</p>

      <p class="text-gray-300">Every game is available in any chat session. Just tap the games icon and pick one. It's the easiest way to turn a random match into a memorable conversation.</p>
    </article>

    <div class="text-center py-8 border-t border-gray-800">
      <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4">Ready to play games with strangers?</p>
      <a href="/chat" class="inline-block bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-medium transition">Start Playing Now</a>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="border-t border-gray-800 py-8 text-center text-gray-500 text-sm">
    <p>&copy; 2026 Airwalk. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>
</Layout>
